#: src/prefs.js:29
msgid "Shadow"
msgstr "陰影"

#: src/prefs.js:29
msgid "Corners"
msgstr "圓角"

#: src/prefs.js:125 src/prefs.js:133
msgid "OK"
msgstr "確定"

#: src/prefs.js:153
msgid "General"
msgstr "一般"

#: src/prefs.js:159
msgid "Display & Rendering"
msgstr "顯示與渲染"

#: src/prefs.js:160
msgid "Control window decoration behavior across screen scales"
msgstr "控制視窗裝飾在不同螢幕縮放下的渲染行為"

#: src/prefs.js:165
msgid "Prioritize Crisp Text"
msgstr "優先保證文字清晰"

#: src/prefs.js:166
msgid ""
"Skip rounded corners on fractional scale monitors (retaining shadow) to "
"avoid text blur and resampling overhead"
msgstr ""
"在分數縮放螢幕上免除圓角（保留陰影），消除重新取樣帶來的字體模糊與效能損耗"

#: src/prefs.js:178
msgid "Suppress Rules"
msgstr "屏蔽規則"

#: src/prefs.js:179
msgid ""
"Windows CSD Fixer leaves alone. A switch turned on means that decoration is "
"not drawn."
msgstr "CSD Fixer 不處理的視窗。開啟某個開關表示不繪製該裝飾。"

#: src/prefs.js:180
msgid "Suppress Window…"
msgstr "屏蔽視窗…"

#: src/prefs.js:182
msgid "Click an on-screen window to stop decorating it"
msgstr "點選螢幕上的視窗，停止為它加上裝飾"

#: src/prefs.js:183
msgid "No Suppress Rules"
msgstr "尚無屏蔽規則"

#: src/prefs.js:187
msgid "Force Rules"
msgstr "強制規則"

#: src/prefs.js:188
msgid ""
"Windows CSD Fixer decorates even when detection assumes Mutter or the "
"application already drew something. A switch turned on means that decoration "
"is forced on."
msgstr ""
"即使自動判定認為 Mutter 或應用程式已經畫過，CSD Fixer 仍會為該視窗繪製裝飾。"
"開啟某個開關表示強制繪製該裝飾。"

#: src/prefs.js:189
msgid "Force Window…"
msgstr "強制視窗…"

#: src/prefs.js:191
msgid "Click an on-screen window to decorate it despite detection"
msgstr "點選螢幕上的視窗，無視自動判定強制加上裝飾"

#: src/prefs.js:192
msgid "No Force Rules"
msgstr "尚無強制規則"

#: src/prefs.js:269
msgid "Remove Rule"
msgstr "刪除規則"

#: src/prefs.js:321
msgid "Window Inspection Failed"
msgstr "視窗選取失敗"

#: src/prefs.js:322
msgid ""
"Could not connect to CSD Fixer extension. Please ensure the extension is "
"enabled."
msgstr ""
"無法連線至 CSD Fixer 擴充套件，請確認該擴充套件已在 GNOME 擴充套件中啟用。"

#: src/prefs.js:338
msgid "Window Not Recognized"
msgstr "無法辨識視窗"

#: src/prefs.js:339
msgid "CSD Fixer could not identify this window, so no rule was created."
msgstr "CSD Fixer 無法辨識這個視窗，因此沒有建立規則。"

#: src/prefs.js:352
msgid "Rule Not Saved"
msgstr "規則未儲存"

#: src/prefs.js:353
msgid "CSD Fixer could not store a rule for this window."
msgstr "CSD Fixer 無法為這個視窗儲存規則。"

#: src/prefs.js:359
#, javascript-format
msgid "Added rule for \"%s\""
msgstr "已為「%s」新增排除規則"
